OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor saunas considered to boost
OL,4,Acouncil income
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew electric outdoor saunas are being
OL,7,Fconsidered by a south-west London
OL,8,Fcouncil to boost its income.
OL,10,FRichmond council told the Local
OL,11,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS) it
OL,12,Fis researching sustainable models,
OL,13,Fincluding electric-powered options
OL,14,Frather than traditional wood-fired
OL,15,Fsaunas.
OL,17,FIt comes as the authority tackles
OL,18,Ffinancial pressures, with a new
OL,19,Fgovernment funding formula set to cut
OL,20,Fits core funding by #29m a year by
OL,21,F2029, equivalent to 58% of its central
OL,22,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
