OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor saunas considered to boost
OL,4,Acouncil income
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has put forward a major
OL,7,Ftransformation programme to overhaul
OL,8,Fits departments and save #39m annually
OL,9,Fby 2029. A report on the plans says the
OL,10,Fauthority is also looking at ways to
OL,11,Fraise cash, including providing outdoor
OL,12,Fsaunas.
